WEBVTT

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:07.280
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> Hello? Tony?

00:00:07.605 --> 00:00:11.009
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Oh, hi, darling. How’s Zurich?

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:16.651
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> Fine, fine. I’m staying in a nice hotel – but it’s raining.

00:00:16.889 --> 00:00:18.013
Can you hear it?

00:00:18.131 --> 00:00:20.131
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Yes, yes, I can.

00:00:20.337 --> 00:00:21.565
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> How are the children?

00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:23.465
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Oh, they’re fine.

00:00:23.897 --> 00:00:26.161
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> Where are they? What are they doing?

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:31.301
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Lily’s in the living room. She’s doing her homework.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:35.199
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> And Matt and Josh?

00:00:35.365 --> 00:00:39.049
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> They’re in their bedroom. They’re reading.

00:00:39.953 --> 00:00:44.229
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> I think I can hear them. Are you sure they’re reading?

00:00:44.432 --> 00:00:47.544
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Yes, yes. That noise is the TV.

00:00:47.703 --> 00:00:50.016
Your mother’s watching a film.

00:00:51.044 --> 00:00:53.368
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> What about you? Are you OK?

00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:57.970
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> I’m fine. I’m making dinner – fish and vegetables.

00:00:57.995 --> 00:01:00.772
<v><b>Carol:</b></v> Oh, great! Very healthy.

00:01:01.071 --> 00:01:05.097
OK darling, I need to go now. See you on Tuesday.

00:01:05.243 --> 00:01:08.019
<v><b>Tony:</b></v> Have a good day tomorrow. Bye.